{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q412534","formula":"C₂₄H₂₆N₂O₄","hill":"C24H26N2O4","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":24.0,"H":26.0,"N":2.0,"O":4.0},"names":{"en":"Carvedilol","ru":"Карведилол","uk":"Карведилол"},"descriptions":{"en":"Carvedilol, sold under the brand name Coreg among others, is a beta blocker medication, that may be prescribed for the treatment of high blood pressure (hypertension) and chronic heart failure with reduced ejection fraction (also known as HFrEF or systolic heart failure). Beta-blockers as a collective medication class are not recommended as routine first-line treatment of high blood pressure for all patients, due to evidence demonstrating less effective cardiovascular protection and a less favourable safety profile when compared to other classes of blood pressure-lowering medications.","ru":"Карведилол — α- и β-адреноблокатор без внутренней симпатомиметической активности.","uk":"Карведило́л — синтетичний антигіпертензивний препарат, що належить до групи неселективних бета-блокаторів, для перорального застосування. Карведилол уперше синтезований Фріцем Відеманом із компанії «Boehringer Mannheim», та запатентований у США у 1995 році."},"fame":34,"pubchemCid":2585,"mass":406.5,"charge":0,"smiles":"COC1=CC=CC=C1OCCNCC(COC2=CC=CC3=C2C4=CC=CC=C4N3)O","inchikey":"OGHNVEJMJSYVRP-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"1-(9H-carbazol-4-yloxy)-3-[2-(2-methoxyphenoxy)ethylamino]propan-2-ol","classes":[{"qid":"Q59199015","names":{"en":"group of stereoisomers","ru":"группа стереоизомеров","uk":"група стереоізомерів"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"2585","atoms":56,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-2.42,"y":1.709,"z":0.111,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.364,"y":4.475,"z":-0.16,"el":"O"},{"x":2.778,"y":0.683,"z":-0.881,"el":"O"},{"x":1.498,"y":-0.502,"z":1.289,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.543,"y":-2.935,"z":-0.204,"el":"N"},{"x":0.903,"y":2.754,"z":-0.435,"el":"N"},{"x":-2.528,"y":-0.715,"z":